  "description": "U-Jin’s first love is dead. Not that he’d be particularly overjoyed to reunite with the intense guy who stole his heart in highschool under more normal circumstances, mind you, but having to attend his funeral feels like a slap in the face to his already unresolved feelings. So, when he starts dreaming about the late Jae-Ha, U-Jin chalks it up to nothing more than his tumultuous emotions. Except, the dreams start taking a…sensual turn. So, when a mysterious man shows up to warn U-Jin of the dangers of getting involved with ghosts, U-Jin is left with a decision to make: just how much pleasure is worth the dangers of this spectrophilia… \n\n(Source: Lezhin US, edited)\n\n*Note: Includes ten extras.*",
